# Felwood (Horde) - Recipes companion (pack butler-routes-completionist, v1).
# Only recipes and patterns whose SOURCE is physically in Felwood for a
# Horde buyer, verified against the local Forever game data
# (questie-forever item vendor and drop tables). Fourteen ship as buys
# from Meilosh at Timbermaw Hold (his full recipe stock, each sole-sold
# by him anywhere in the data); one ships as a buy from Bale (Horde).
# Eight ship as mob drops with droppers spawning only in Felwood.
# Meilosh is Timbermaw Hold's neutral vendor: the data encodes no
# standing requirement for any of his 14 recipes (no reputation field
# anywhere in the item, vendor or quest dumps), so every Meilosh step
# says to check Timbermaw Hold standing in game rather than inventing a
# tier. Everything else Felwood-dropping is a generic multi-zone world
# drop (Elwynn rule, argued per case in the inventory - including the
# 20-zone Warbear Harness drop leg, the STV-object Harness twin, the
# Mongoose triple-leg and the dual-zone single-droppers shared with
# Darkshore's ground). Quest records carry no reward data, so no
# quest-reward recipe ships (see docs/companion-unverified.md).
# Trainer-taught staples are excluded: Polestar's own profession guides
# cover those. Each step is gated to its profession; other characters
# skip it cleanly. First Aid and Fishing have no Felwood Horde source,
# so that is stated, not padded.
guide butler-routes-completionist/felwood-horde-recipes
title Felwood (Horde) - Recipes
levels 45-48
zone Felwood
faction Horde
category Professions
folder Companions
keywords felwood, horde, recipes, patterns, professions, companions
coords live
version 1

step Timbermaw Hold - transmute (Alchemy)

  zone map 1448

  when skill Alchemy 1

  vendor 11557 -- Meilosh (65.69, 2.81)
  buy 13484 "Recipe: Transmute Earth to Water" npc 11557
  note Meilosh (Timbermaw Hold, neutral) is the sole vendor anywhere in the data. The data encodes no Timbermaw standing requirement - check standing in game before the trip. Stock class is unconfirmed in the data (no limited flag either way).

step Timbermaw Hold - warbear and timbermaw leathers (Leatherworking)

  zone map 1448

  when skill Leatherworking 1

  vendor 11557 -- Meilosh (65.69, 2.81)
  buy 15742 "Pattern: Warbear Harness" npc 11557
  buy 15754 "Pattern: Warbear Woolies" npc 11557
  buy 19215 "Pattern: Wisdom of the Timbermaw" npc 11557
  buy 19326 "Pattern: Might of the Timbermaw" npc 11557
  buy 19327 "Pattern: Timbermaw Brawlers" npc 11557
  buy 20253 "Pattern: Warbear Harness" npc 11557
  buy 20254 "Pattern: Warbear Woolies" npc 11557
  note Meilosh (Timbermaw Hold, neutral) is the sole vendor anywhere in the data for all seven. 15742 also drops across 20 zones (generic world drop - no drop step here); 20253's only other source is an out-of-zone Stranglethorn object; 20254 has no other source at all. 15754 additionally drops off Deadwood furbolgs below. The data encodes no Timbermaw standing requirement - check standing in game before the trip. Stock class is unconfirmed in the data (no limited flag either way).

