step Felwood south - monster omelet (Cooking)

  zone map 1448

  when skill Cooking 1

  vendor 2806 -- Bale (34.75, 53.23)
  buy 16110 "Recipe: Monster Omelet" npc 2806
  note Bale (Horde) sells the recipe in-zone; Malygen nearby stocks it for the Alliance and one out-of-zone vendor also carries it. Stock class is unconfirmed in the data (no limited flag either way).

