step No Felwood Horde source - First Aid
  note First Aid has no recipe source physically in Felwood for a Horde buyer in the data - no vendor sells them here and no in-zone mob drops them - so this guide carries nothing for it. Polestar's own profession guides cover trainer-taught staples.

